# Also: StorageAttachment._release_pending_storage_ops (storage_attachment.py:357-) pops ongoing_backup
# entries on detach; call finish_storage_write(node, op, stored=False) there, or the node keeps a pending
# mark for an op nobody will ack and unstored_ancestors() skips it for good.
# The lock is released at the ack whatever the outcome, as today and as
# test_pending_write_tokens_leave_with_each_acked_or_released_write pins: a store that fails every write
# must not pin host memory.

